   The Simulation Setup Agent will take the two cleaned PDB files from the Preprocessing Agent and construct a full GROMACS simulation system.  
   1. **Ligand Parameterization** – The agent will first invoke `generate_ligand_parameters` on `ligand_clean.pdb`. This tool uses acpype/antechamber to produce an AMBER GAFF/GAFF2 topology and coordinate files for ATP. The resulting ligand topology (`ATP.itp`) and coordinate file (`ATP.gro`) will be stored in the system folder.  
